This endpoint returns the status and download URL for a previously submitted trades request. Append the request id to the end of the url — a pre-signed URL is returned allowing you to download the data set.

 URL should follow the below format:

 https://data-pricing-api.lukka.tech/v1/trades/historical/requests/{requestId}

